{"id": 1988, "name": "B Berry Farms & Co.", "read": "2026-10-16", "pages": [{"url": "https://bberryfarms.com/park-info", "lines": ["PARK INFO We have farm fresh peppers hot/sweet for $0.25 a piece and squash for $0.50 a piece. | Home | Purchase Our Products | PARK INFO | U Pick Berries Sum Picking Information | | Photos | Photos | Recipes | About Us | Goodness | Odds & Ends | Maki", " | Hours | Policies | Account | Bookings | Orders | My Account | Sign out | | Sign In | Bookings | Orders | My Account | NEW THINGS HAPPENING IN Spring 2026 : New Games | Things to do around our farm | water park area | $5.00 per day per person for campers, $7.00 for non campers For campers $5.00 per person per day, Play Park is Free when the water is not on, BUT if you want to change it up a little try the water ver", " we have lights for private rented nighttime fun during the summer heat. | Horseshoe Pitching | Free We have 2 different areas to play | kids zip line | Free something for the little ones, free with campground purchase. $10.00 Hour for non-campers. | Ax Throwing | Free Develop those skills or just have fun | Play nets | free Roll, bounce and play or just relax with a good book. | Play Pool | Free Up to 4 play can pla", "day. No Refunds on camping reservations all sales are final. Also Extended stays now offered from November 1 to march 1.. Price includes the use of the Recreational Area's Concessions a microwave, | B's Barn Bunkhouse | $39 Night This 12' x 12' space has a glass front wood stove with wood, air-conditioning, cold running water,a small refrigerator( bottled water provided), a 1Toaster oven/fryer, a coffee maker, a Croc", "nk shelf (they are a little bigger than a queen). The top shelf is 72\"L, 24\"W with a 250lb limit,. Restrooms are 150' away. check-in at 2:00 p.m. and Check-out at 10:00 am. 20.00 pet fee per stay. | Busy Bee's Landing | $ 20 Night Located at the top of the blueberry rows. Nestled in 50+ years-old cedar trees. This price offers you a park grill, picnic table, and a metal fire ring. This get-together spot has a 20-amps", " ring. This get-together spot has a 20-amps with (4) electrical outlets ( 20 amps total ) and dimmable outdoor lights all for 20.00 night. This site also has options for RV add ons. IF YOU ONLY WANT 30 Amps for RV it is $24.00 a night) or BUNDLE get both 20amp campsite and 30amp RV plugin for 30.00 night. | | | RV There Yet 20 or 30amp (w/50amp add-om | $26 Night A Nice quiet spot at the front of our farm and next to", "t. This site also has options for RV add ons. IF YOU ONLY WANT 30 Amps for RV it is $24.00 a night) or BUNDLE get both 20amp campsite and 30amp RV plugin for 30.00 night. | | | RV There Yet 20 or 30amp (w/50amp add-om | $26 Night A Nice quiet spot at the front of our farm and next to the start of our berry fields. 50 AMP Electric Hookup ($29 night)or (2) 30 Amp ($20 night) your choice. Comes with fire pit and a picni", "0amp campsite and 30amp RV plugin for 30.00 night. | | | RV There Yet 20 or 30amp (w/50amp add-om | $26 Night A Nice quiet spot at the front of our farm and next to the start of our berry fields. 50 AMP Electric Hookup ($29 night)or (2) 30 Amp ($20 night) your choice. Comes with fire pit and a picnic table. Check-in is at 1:00 pm and check-out is at 12:00 noon. You can Check-in at 1:00 pm not 8 pm ( we have it at 8 p", "heck-out is at 12:00 noon. You can Check-in at 1:00 pm not 8 pm ( we have it at 8 pm so late arrivals can still book online up to 8 pm then you have to call or text ). No black Sewer Dump. we do have gray water dump for $10.00 per dump. Water hookup is 15' away. | RV with Bee | $ 25 Night A plain 30 amp electric or (2) 20amp 110v electric, picnic table, fire-pit at the front of our berry farm. Must call to reserve. |", "ump for $10.00 per dump. Water hookup is 15' away. | RV with Bee | $ 25 Night A plain 30 amp electric or (2) 20amp 110v electric, picnic table, fire-pit at the front of our berry farm. Must call to reserve. | RV Pop'n | $25 Night This is our 4th RV Spot, it is a new Pull-through RV spot at the front of the farm and it has (1) 30 amp plug-in or (2) 20 amp outlets to plug- in to you decide. It has a fire ring and water", "$25 Night This is our 4th RV Spot, it is a new Pull-through RV spot at the front of the farm and it has (1) 30 amp plug-in or (2) 20 amp outlets to plug- in to you decide. It has a fire ring and water. | Campers point | $18 Night We are offering a Very Large Group Camp Site at the front of our Berry Farm. It Can Accommodate 14 to 16 People ( 8 Tents or so or an RV ). It Has A 6' Rock Fire Pit and a Park Grill. ( bigg", "th this one ). Horseshoe Pitching poles are 20' from this site. Check-in is at 1:00 pm and check-out is at 12 noon. Can Call ahead to see if it may be available on short notice due to cancelation. | Honeyberry Hideout | $ 16 Night The site has a 3' Metal Fire Ring, It also has a Picnic Table and Park Grill. This site is for a maximum of 6 people at a time due to its location next to berry plants. (IF YOU WANT 15 or 3", "so has a Picnic Table and Park Grill. This site is for a maximum of 6 people at a time due to its location next to berry plants. (IF YOU WANT 15 or 30 Amps RV hookup added also. CALL US AND WE WILL DO the whole site FOR $30 a night) | | | Misty Woods w/add-on heated A-frame | $14 Night This campsite has 15 amp electric service. It is very close to the play area, it is made for 8-10 Campers. It has a fire pit and a pr", "/add-on heated A-frame | $14 Night This campsite has 15 amp electric service. It is very close to the play area, it is made for 8-10 Campers. It has a fire pit and a private entrance from the trail systems. For an extra $8.00 a night it has a 60 sq-ft Wooden A-frame. (28.00 Total) | Cozy Oaks | $13 night If You are looking for an off-the-beaten-path adventure for a few days of relaxation, we may have what you are loo", "laxation, we may have what you are looking for. Our newest walk-in ONLY campsite deep in our forest. You will cross a small wooden log bridge and much more to get there. For more info call 417-933-2046 | Cedar Hollows | $10 Night We are offering a Large Camp Site Carved Out Of a Grove Of 30+Year-Old Cedar Trees. Can Accommodate 6 to 8 People max ( 3 Tents ). Paths all leading in different directions off of the fire p", "ions off of the fire pit. It Has A 3' Solid Metal Fire Ring W/ 4 Built-In Concrete Seats with a Concrete Table. ( please keep fires below 3' ). Check-in is at 1:00 pm and check-out is at 12 noon. | Rustling Bush Ridge | $10 Night Rustling Ridge is a Medium Camp Site Carved Out Of a Grove Of 25+Year-Old Cedar Trees. Can Accommodate 4 to 6 People max ( 2 or 3 Tents ). Paths all leading in different directions off of th", "ons off of the fire pit. It Has A 3' Fire Ring W/ 4 Built-In Concrete Seats with a Concrete Table. Check-in is at 1:00 pm and check-out is at 12:00 noon. Horseshoe Pitching poles are 260' from this site. | Lonely pine | $14 Night The price is for this large shady campsite that can accommodate 3-4 tents. It is located next to a seasonal pond at the back of the berry field and is tucked in among a 25+-year-old cedar gr", "pond at the back of the berry field and is tucked in among a 25+-year-old cedar grove and a lonely pine. It comes with a fire pit and logs to sit on. Also available is a 15 amp heated wooden 60 Sqft A-frame for an extra $8.00 a night. (28.00 Total) | Whistling Woods | $10 Night A small little spot nestled in the back of the property with a fire pit and logs to sit on. During really wet weather a small walk-in ( 2minu", "Valley Run | 9$ Night This spot is tucked in among 25+year old cedar trees and a wind break all along one side. This site can hold 3 or 4 regular tents and it comes with a fire ring and stumps to sit on. | Rabbits Den | $9 Night Tucked away off the beaten path this is a truly unique space we have found. This small space is just for two people. It comes with a metal fire ring ( Please keep fires under 3', we don't wan", "This small space is just for two people. It comes with a metal fire ring ( Please keep fires under 3', we don't want to set the den on fire. :) . Check-in is at 1:00 pm and check-out is at 12:00 noon. | Pullin On Over | $8 Night This price is Just a spot to pull on over nothing fancy, located at the front of our property. The site has a 3' Metal Fire Ring, This site is for a maximum of 4 people at a time. Can Call ah"]}, {"url": "https://bberryfarms.com/ola/services/b-s-barn-bunkhouse", "error": "<HTTPError 404: 'Not Found'>"}, {"url": "https://bberryfarms.com/ola/services/busy-bees-electrified-landing", "lines": ["Busy Bees Landing ( 20 AMP or add on 30 AMP) We have farm fresh peppers hot/sweet for $0.25 a piece and squash for $0.50 a piece. | Home | Purchase Our Products | PARK INFO | U Pick Berries Sum Picking Information | | Photos | Photos | Recipes | About Us | Goodness | Odds & Ends | Maki", " | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | FREE SHIPPING on $35.00 orders or more. | New Trail Videos | Which Way? | Slow and steady horse rides thru the fields. | Which Way? | Slow and steady horse rides thru the fields. | Off We Go | Deep in The woods | We t"], "via": ""}, {"url": "https://bberryfarms.com/ola/services/rv-there-yet", "lines": ["RV There Yet 30amp (W/20, 30 or 50 Amp Add-On) We have farm fresh peppers hot/sweet for $0.25 a piece and squash for $0.50 a piece. | Home | Purchase Our Products | PARK INFO | U Pick Berries Sum Picking Information | | Photos | Photos | Recipes | About Us | Goodness | Odds & Ends | Maki", " | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | FREE SHIPPING on $35.00 orders or more. | New Trail Videos | Wh